n handling blood or bodily fluids containing blood?).","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026293914","violation_type_title":"Director Annual Training - Additional required topics (26 TAC §746.1311(e))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1188939-i20240206-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1205-a-3","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1188939-i20240206","date":"2024-02-06","original_code":"746.1205(a)(3)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Know children's names and ages: A caregiver caring for a group of children was unable to provide each child's age. The caregiver did not have information available in the room showing each child's age.         Note: This was CORRECTED during the inspection when a list with each child's name and age was created and posted in the room.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026534802","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Know children's names and ages (26 TAC §746.1205(a)(3))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1188939-i20240206-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1301-a-3-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1188939-i20240206","date":"2024-02-06","original_code":"746.1301(a)(3)(A)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-03-04","finding":"Training Requirements for Employees, Caregivers, and Directors - Pediatric First Aid with Rescue Breathing: A caregiver caring for a group of children did not have trianing in Pediatric first aid with rescue breathing.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026534803","violation_type_title":"Training Requirements for Employees, Caregivers, and Directors - Pediatric First Aid with Rescue Breathing (26 TAC §746.1301(a)(3)(A))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1188939-i20230209","date":"2023-02